sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as MediFind (Django)
    participant DB as Database
    actor O as Pharmacy owner

    C->>W: Search medicine, click "Request Availability"
    C->>W: POST quantity + note
    W->>DB: Check rules (approved pharmacy, medicine listed,<br/>no duplicate pending request, max 10 per hour)
    W->>DB: Save request (PENDING) + notification for owner
    W-->>C: "Request sent"
    O->>W: Open inbox, open the request
    W->>DB: Mark owner's notification for this request as read
    O->>W: POST answer
    alt Confirm
        W->>DB: UPDATE status = CONFIRMED WHERE status = PENDING
    else Partially available
        W->>DB: UPDATE status = PARTIAL, available_quantity (1 to requested - 1)<br/>WHERE status = PENDING
    else Decline
        W->>DB: UPDATE status = UNAVAILABLE WHERE status = PENDING
    end
    W->>DB: Save notification for customer
    W-->>O: "Response recorded" (request is now answered, cannot change)
    C->>W: Open My Requests / notifications
    W-->>C: Status, e.g. "60 of 100 available", and pharmacy message
